{"result":"{
  "id": "18130",
  "key": "SFCC-92",
  "summary": "PDP — Size Selection & Add to Bag",
  "url": "https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/18130",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper,\n**I want** to select my size and add a product to my bag directly from the PDP,\n**so that** I can quickly purchase the item I want in the right size.\n\n----\n\nImage for reference (figma leading): \n\n\n![\"image-20260701-120944.png\"](image-20260701-120944.png)\n\n\nThis story covers the size selector component on the PDP and the Add to Bag CTA. Size availability is derived from inventory levels - integration not in this user story - we can configure some inventory in the test environment. The Add to Bag cart integration is out of scope; this story covers the display and enabled/disabled state of the CTA based on size selection and stock availability. Find in Boutique and Notify Me slide-out are separate stories.",
  "status": {
    "name": "In Progress",
    "category": "In Progress",
    "color": "yellow"
  },
  "issue_type": {
    "name": "Story"
  },
  "priority": {
    "name": "High"
  },
  "assignee": {
    "display_name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
    "name": "Jhoan Rose Dela Cruz",
    "email": "jhoan.rose.dela.cruz@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:26b54c48-03dc-4b75-9a3b-4e924b0a4580/f69f9733-9221-48a9-aada-84ece49d3074/48"
  },
  "reporter": {
    "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
    "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
  },
  "labels": [
    "CAI-024",
    "CAI-026",
    "CAI-027",
    "CAI-028",
    "CAI-030",
    "Custom",
    "DesignDependent",
    "OM-029",
    "PRD-012",
    "PRD-014",
    "PRD-016",
    "PRD-018",
    "Squad-A"
  ],
  "created": "2026-07-01T22:07:03.596+1000",
  "updated": "2026-08-28T16:42:23.122+1000",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": "13368",
      "body": "Designs signed off today:  pdp for a one-size item, low stock indicator (should be Limited Availability), add to bag state management (coming soon, unavailable).",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-07T15:21:49.771+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-07T15:21:49.771+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13369",
      "body": "User:557058:a8d3e24a-618f-49c2-a524-9f82f1ad6b1b For the team to pick this up - we need to have product states like Coming Soon - is that OOTB sfcc or do we need a custom product attribute for this?",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-07T15:27:18.788+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-07T15:27:18.788+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13402",
      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 I have split out the Coming Soon / Unavailable (all sizes) states as a separate user story and notified Charmaine to work on that design. This story for the ‘base version’ of the size selector is now ready for your review.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-14T12:13:07.798+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-14T12:13:07.798+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13528",
      "body": "Hey User:557058:a8d3e24a-618f-49c2-a524-9f82f1ad6b1b / User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d - Do you mind helping User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d  out with this question?",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "email": "timothy.lavelle@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8/69afd82c-3275-4f1a-82c5-96388b537351/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-26T08:27:29.041+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-26T08:27:29.041+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13529",
      "body": "Hey User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d, just continuing on with my UI story reviews 🙂 My view is that the Size Selector and Add to Bag should be different components and user stories because some items won’t have a size selector, so we don’t want to tie these two items together. The Add to Bag component will have some validation rules configured likely in SFCC and the codebase on when it is available to be clicked on. User:557058:a8d3e24a-618f-49c2-a524-9f82f1ad6b1b  / User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d - Can you help shed some light on this?\n\nI won’t go through the A/Cs individually given I think it’s best we split these out. \n\nThanks Jas!",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "email": "timothy.lavelle@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/557058:1a7fb05a-783b-4241-a0f1-9a7b046da3a8/69afd82c-3275-4f1a-82c5-96388b537351/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-26T08:30:25.436+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-26T08:31:04.324+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13723",
      "body": "Hi Tim, better late than never - \n\n  - **SFCC-648* `pdp/size-selector` — the React component, all size/stock states, one-size variant, full accessibility AC (WCAG 2.1 AA). Under SFCC-2.\n  - **SFCC-650* `pdp/add-to-bag` — the React component wrapping the base button, validation logic, cart API call, accessibility. Under SFCC-2.\n  - **SFCC-92* (updated) — now just covers wiring these two components together on the PDP page: fetching product/stock data from SFCC and passing it as props, rendering both components in the correct position, and confirming size selection state flows through to Add to Bag. Thin story, this one stays in SFCC-5. User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d  User:712020:08a6f120-c836-4f71-92db-c97999401c49 User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
        "email": "jasmijn.tsang@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d/40fcd533-06f6-4e5b-ba9f-23879e1193f9/48"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-07T16:07:38.028+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-07T16:07:38.028+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14014",
      "body": "⚠️ All DoR checklist items must be completed before moving this issue forward. The issue has been moved back automatically. \n\nUser:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac  Please complete all items in the checklist and try again.",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Automation for Jira",
        "name": "Automation for Jira",
        "email": null,
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/600529a9c8bfef89daa848e6db28ed2d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAJ-0.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-25T11:47:14.174+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-25T11:47:14.174+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14015",
      "body": "This will be developed with [SFCC-737](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-737)",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-08-25T11:47:55.111+1000",
      "updated": "2026-08-25T11:47:55.111+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "14019",
      "body": "AC1 and AC3 mention archived user stories - they should be replaced by [SFCC-737](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-737) User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac User:712020:26b54c48-03dc-4b75-9a3b-4e924b0a4580",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Jasmijn Tsang",
