      "body": "User:712020:c99d37b3-9c93-4347-951d-5ffb32ff1341 I have split out the Coming Soon / Unavailable (all sizes) states as a separate user story and notified Charmaine to work on that design. This story for the ‘base version’ of the size selector is now ready for your review.",
