      "updated": "2026-07-26T08:27:29.041+1000"
    },
    {
      "id": "13529",
      "body": "Hey User:5cc71886cbbec211ec62929d, just continuing on with my UI story reviews 🙂 My view is that the Size Selector and Add to Bag should be different components and user stories because some items won’t have a size selector, so we don’t want to tie these two items together. The Add to Bag component will have some validation rules configured likely in SFCC and the codebase on when it is available to be clicked on. User:557058:a8d3e24a-618f-49c2-a524-9f82f1ad6b1b  / User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d - Can you help shed some light on this?\n\nI won’t go through the A/Cs individually given I think it’s best we split these out. \n\nThanks Jas!",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "name": "Tim Lavelle",
        "email": "timothy.lavelle@accenture.com",
