    },
    {
      "id": "13723",
      "body": "Hi Tim, better late than never - \n\n  - **SFCC-648* `pdp/size-selector` — the React component, all size/stock states, one-size variant, full accessibility AC (WCAG 2.1 AA). Under SFCC-2.\n  - **SFCC-650* `pdp/add-to-bag` — the React component wrapping the base button, validation logic, cart API call, accessibility. Under SFCC-2.\n  - **SFCC-92* (updated) — now just covers wiring these two components together on the PDP page: fetching product/stock data from SFCC and passing it as props, rendering both components in the correct position, and confirming size selection state flows through to Add to Bag. Thin story, this one stays in SFCC-5. User:557058:09af9e5b-661b-42a2-90ec-9ce9f69d324d  User:712020:08a6f120-c836-4f71-92db-c97999401c49 User:5f506d223e9e2e004d7c48ac",
